{"severity":"error","file":"errors/linear_never_used_26.march","start_line":8,"start_col":2,"end_line":15,"end_col":5,"message":"The linear value `c` was never used on a path that returns.\nIt is consumed only on paths that never return (they end in `panic`), so wherever the function does return the value is dropped. Consume it on that path too.","code":"linear_never_used","fix":null,"labels":[{"file":"errors/linear_never_used_26.march","start_line":11,"start_col":22,"end_line":11,"end_col":23,"message":"`c` is consumed here, but this path never returns"},{"file":"errors/linear_never_used_26.march","start_line":13,"start_col":15,"end_line":13,"end_col":16,"message":"The `Ok(v)` arm returns without consuming `c`"}],"notes":[],"category":"LINEARITY"}
